<body id="thebody" style="defaultCaption">
	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.333" end="00:00:02.100">Here in Iowa, these are<br />some fun words</p>
		<p begin="00:00:02.100" end="00:00:03.800">that begin with the letter &quot;p.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:03.800" end="00:00:04.867">(makes &quot;p&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:04.867" end="00:00:06.400">Pig.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:06.400" end="00:00:08.867">Paint.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:08.867" end="00:00:10.800">Pants.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:10.800" end="00:00:12.333">Pumpkin.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:12.333" end="00:00:14.867">Penny.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:14.867" end="00:00:16.600">Pan.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:16.600" end="00:00:18.733">Pizza.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:18.733" end="00:00:21.533">Mmm... pie.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:21.533" end="00:00:22.400">&quot;P.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:22.400" end="00:00:23.400">(makes &quot;p&quot; sound)</p>
</div>
